ithub.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123574","id":5720256878,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVPQxbg","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-17T19:47:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T19:47:28Z","body":"> Can you include multiple Godot projects exported as `.aar`'s in the same Android app? It would be cool if that were possible, potentially, embedding each into different activities\r\n\r\nNot with the default export flow, because all the project metadata is stored in the `assets` folder of the `aar`, and at build time, that folder is merged with the `assets` folder of the host application, and any other library dependencies. So the multiple projects would overwrite each other within the merged `assets` folder.\r\n\r\nHowever if you export the project metadata as a `pck` or `zip` file, then that could work, and the merged `assets` folder would contain all the `pck` / `zip` files.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5720256878/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,